## 9. FRAMELESS WINDOW — WIN32 MESSAGE FLOW

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  HOW THE TOP BAR ACTUALLY DISAPPEARS (WinForms WndProc)                              │
│                                                                                      │
│   Windows sends:                                                                     │
│                                                                                      │
│   WM_NCCALCSIZE (0x83)  ──►  Your code returns 0  ──►  "No non-client area"         │
│        ↑                                                    │                        │
│        │                                                    ▼                        │
│   DWM normally draws:                                  Result:                       │
│   • Title bar (caption)                                • Zero pixels at top          │
│   • Min/max/close buttons                              • Full window = client area   │
│   • 1px border line                                    • Shadow stays (NCACTIVATE)  │
│   • Resize handles                                     • Resize handles (NCHITTEST)   │
│                                                                                      │
│   WM_NCHITTEST (0x84)  ──►  Your code checks cursor position:                       │
│   • Top 8px → HTTOP                                                                  │
│   • Bottom 8px → HTBOTTOM                                                            │
│   • Left 8px → HTLEFT                                                                │
│   • Right 8px → HTRIGHT                                                              │
│   • Corners → HTCORNER                                                               │
│   • Toolbar area → HTCAPTION (allows dragging)                                       │
│   • Content area → HTCLIENT                                                          │
│                                                                                      │
│   WM_NCACTIVATE (0x86)  ──►  Pass to base  ──►  Window shadow + focus glow stays     │
│                                                                                      │
│   CUSTOM CONTROLS (in chrome-ui/index.html):                                         │
│   • ☐ minimize  → postMessage(\"minimize\")  → C# WindowState = Minimized            │
│   • □ maximize  → postMessage(\"maximize\")  → C# ToggleMaximize()                   │
│   • ✕ close     → postMessage(\"close\")     → C# Close()                            │
│                                                                                      │
│   DRAGGING:                                                                          │
│   • MouseDown on toolbar area → postMessage(\"dragWindow\")                            │
│   • C# calls ReleaseCapture() + SendMessage(Handle, WM_NCLBUTTONDOWN, HTCAPTION, 0)  │
│                                                                                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

